I am home in the flat again.
I am standing in the kitchen.
I empty the bag on the kitchen counter.
I unpack the food.
I take the milk.
I put the milk in the fridge.
Then I look at the parsnip.
It is a funny root.
I will use it in my soup.
I put the parsnip in the fridge.
Now the fridge is not empty.
I take the bread.
The rye bread is very heavy.
I put the bread in the cupboard.
Then I take the can of beans.
Beans last a long time.
I put the can in the cupboard.
Now there is food in the cupboard.
I am quite hungry.
I would like to have dinner now.
